<title>BELGIUM: Belgian Econocom H1 1996 profit flat.</title>
<headline>Belgian Econocom H1 1996 profit flat.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited accounts for six months to June 30, 1996 (in millions of Belgian francs unless stated):</p>
<p>    Cons turnover/sales	  4,550  vs  4,574</p>
<p>    Cons operating profit	   78  vs    100</p>
<p>    Cons current profit	     46  vs     57</p>
<p>    Cons net profit		   60  vs     61</p>
<p>NOTE - Belgian Econocom Group distributes and leases computers in Belgium, the Netherlands, France and Luxembourg.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said it saw full year sales of 9.5 billion Belgian francs. Current profit for the year should &quot;not evolve unfavourably&quot;, the company said.</p>
<p>-- Nick Antonovics, Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6817, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
